    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo: The Naked Clue</strong> is a visual novel where characters from the Italian Brainrot memes dive into a world of noir detective fiction, filled with absurd humor and ridiculous investigations. Alongside <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo</strong>, <strong>Ballerina Cappuccina</strong>, and other iconic characters, you'll find yourself in an atmosphere of gritty streets, strange conspiracies, and unbelievable twists, where every step may lead to unpredictable consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meme characters such as <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo</strong>, <strong>Ballerina Cappuccina</strong>, <strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong> and other iconic figures from Italian Brainrot brought to life in a detective story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>noir atmosphere</strong>, typical of 1960s detective fiction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satire</strong>, <strong>dark humor</strong>, and dumb (yet funny) jokes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where memes come to life and the script is inspired by <i>Sin City</i>, <i>The Naked Gun</i>, and <i>Archer</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo: The Naked Clue</strong> is a visual novel where characters from the Italian Brainrot memes dive into a world of noir detective fiction, filled with absurd humor and ridiculous investigations. Alongside <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo</strong>, <strong>Ballerina Cappuccina</strong>, and other iconic characters, you'll find yourself in an atmosphere of gritty streets, strange conspiracies, and unbelievable twists, where every step may lead to unpredictable consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meme characters such as <strong>Bombardiro Crocodilo</strong>, <strong>Ballerina Cappuccina</strong>, <strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong> and other iconic figures from Italian Brainrot brought to life in a detective story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>noir atmosphere</strong>, typical of 1960s detective fiction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satire</strong>, <strong>dark humor</strong>, and dumb (yet funny) jokes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where memes come to life and the script is inspired by <i>Sin City</i>, <i>The Naked Gun</i>, and <i>Archer</i>.</p>",
